      en: ["Opened in 1983", "Main galleries are underground", "Houses the 'Crown Jewels' of Haiti", "Located in the heart of the capital"],
      es: ["Fundado en 1983", "Museo subterráneo", "Alberga reliquias nacionales", "Situado en Puerto Príncipe"],
      pt: ["Fundado em 1983", "Museu subterrâneo", "Abriga relíquias nacionais", "Localizado em Porto Príncipe"],
      fr: ["Fondé en 1983", "Musée souterrain", "Abrite des reliques nationales", "Situé à Port-au-Prince"],
