      en: ["Opened officially in the year 1983.", "Houses the anchor of the Santa Maria.", "Contains the remains of Toussaint Louverture.", "Features a largely underground architectural design.", "Located at the Place des Héros de l'Indépendance.", "Documents national history starting from 1492."],
      es: ["El ancla de la Santa María (el barco de Colón) se conserva aquí", "Aquí descansan los restos de Toussaint Louverture y Dessalines", "El edificio está rodeado por los jardines de la Place du Marron Inconnu"],
