      en: ["Built in 1816 under the reign of Henri Christophe.", "Features 365 windows and doors symbolically.", "Located in Petite-Rivière-de-l'Artibonite.", "Official name is Palais de la Belle-Rivière.", "Served as a royal residence and administrative office.", "Prominent example of early Haitian masonry architecture."],
